'''Sage of Logic Newtone''' (理の賢者ニュトーン, ''Kotowari no Kenja Nyutōn'', '''Sage of Logic Nyutone''') is a [[:Category:Red Enemies|Red]]/[[:Category:Sage Enemies|Sage]] enemy that appears in [[Zero Legends]]. He is the enemy version of [[Master of Logic Newtone (Special Cat)|Master of Logic Newtone]]. He was added in [[Version 14.4 Update|Version 14.4]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Sage of Logic Newtone
|image = E 729.png
|first appearance = '''ZL''': [[Immeasurable Power|Sub-chapter 20 - Immeasurable Power]]
|money drop = 8,888¢ - 35,107¢
}}

==Enemy==
A true super-backliner threat, Sage of Logic Newtone has a ridiculous standing range of 700 on top of a jaw-dropping 1,500 [[Omni Strike]] and a whopping 190k damage per hit, which is increased by 1.5x when he reaches 50% health. This means that his fight will be a game of stalling him between peon waves. However he has two staggering weaknesses: his attack cycle lasts for nearly ten seconds, and he has a high knockback count for his HP (2M HP with 8 knockbacks, meaning 1 per 250k damage taken), giving you a chance to slip in lots of damage during the downtimes between his attacks and even juggle him if you manage to get a stack of DPS units on him, trivializing the stage.

Note that despite defying gravity and being slightly above the ground, he isn't a [[:Category:Floating Enemies|Floating]] enemy. Fortunately, as long as the peons are dealt with, his Red trait can still be easily exploited.

